### Enhancements

* Support creating windows environments in other operating systems. This
  fixes creating python entry points for windows from unixes by using
  the stub executable even on other operating systems if the subdir is
  windows. (#15690)
* `conda-launchers` is now a dependency on all platforms so that Windows
  entry point launchers are available when creating `win-*` environments
  from other operating systems. (#15690)
* When creating an environment for another operating system, decide
  `python-scripts/` placement, prefix replacement for noarch packages and
  install ordering from the target subdir instead of the host OS. Link
  scripts that cannot run on the host are skipped with a warning, and pip
  dependencies raise an error. (#15690)

